# CARATOM security gate (Phase 8+)

Phase 1–7 product work is complete. From **Phase 8 onward**, do not mark a phase complete until the **entire repository** has been scanned.

```text
IMPLEMENT PHASE → tests → typecheck → lint → pnpm security (entire repo)
→ fix CRITICAL/HIGH (MEDIUM practical) → rerun suite → then phase complete
```

UI-only phases still run the **full** suite. Do not scan only the diff. Do not point DAST at production.

Load skill `caratom-security-gate`. Details: `security/README.md`.

Never paste live secrets into chat or markdown.
